  "details": "Misleading and/or inconsistent text in the action menu.\n\n1. Redeem a Reference Cube Companion by using the code `CUBEFRIEND`: https://vrch.at/redeem?code=CUBEFRIEND\n\n2. Launch VRChat\n\n3. Open your Quick Menu, navigate to Inventory and Spawn a Reference Cube Companion\n\n4. Open your Quick Menu, navigate to Inventory and Add to Action Menu (Reference Cube Companion)\n\n5. In your Action Menu, navigate to Reference Cube Companion settings. Notice one of the menu buttons says \"Remove\".\n\n6. Navigate to inventory and check the tooltip to remove/put away a Reference Cube Companion, it says \"Put Away\"\n\nExpected result: \"Put Away\" in Action Menu (same as Inventory)\n\nActual result: \"Remove\" in Action Menu\n\nAdditional information: [VRChat 2026.2.1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202621): Changed \"Remove\" button to \"Put Away\" for your own Items.",
